Z||000007||Lady Pegasus||12-31-2001||03:46 PM||||Uh guys, actually the i.d. is to show that you are over 18 and not because of graffiti.  Kids were huffing the spray paint and killing themselves.  So that is why you have to show i.d.  Now Roger, I forgot what state you live in, but do you have a liscense with a bar code on it?  Sometimes you can scan that.  Otherwise there is usually a checker standing there.  And sometimes you just hit a button on the d\mn thing...but if you don`t want to use them, I don`t blame you.  FIGHT THE POWER!!  D\MN THE MAN!!  By the way, that symbol is japanese.  I don`t know what it tands for, but it`s still pretty cool. My friend is dating a Japanese guy and I am using his comp.  Pretty spiffy if you ask me!!<P>------------------<BR>Hey pretty....don't you wanna take a ride with me...through my world?||||reg||4
